WEBVTT

00:13:58.036 --> 00:14:00.636
like, nobody, that wasn't
working for anybody.

00:14:00.636 --> 00:14:02.796
You know, that hustle culture,

00:14:02.836 --> 00:14:04.916
you know that idea
that you give everything,

00:14:04.916 --> 00:14:06.236
you work 80 hours a week

00:14:06.276 --> 00:14:09.516
and you just like, fall apart,
your mental health.

00:14:09.556 --> 00:14:11.436
I mean, we can't go back to that.

00:14:11.796 --> 00:14:13.476
You know, we can't go back to that.

00:14:13.476 --> 00:14:15.276
And so this is our first test.

00:14:15.756 --> 00:14:21.596
Are we up for building something new
collectively, you know,

00:14:21.636 --> 00:14:24.916
that will serve all of us
and will bring us to a place

00:14:24.956 --> 00:14:28.596
where I think we can all heal
and have a little bit more time.

00:14:28.636 --> 00:14:33.436
You know, it's very hard to be empathetic
and to be brave when you're exhausted.